    "knowledgeCheck": "question: Children should be protected from adult conflict wherever possible.\noptions: True\n\nFalse\nanswer: True\nexplanation: Adult conflict can increase fear, loyalty pressure and stress for children.\n\nquestion: The main aim of Conflict resolution is to practise one safer response, not to become perfect in one session.\noptions: True\n\nFalse\nanswer: True\nexplanation: SAFE STEPS lessons focus on practical progress, reflection and repeated safe action.\n\nquestion: Evidence of change can include reflection notes, routines, plans, repair statements, checklists or examples of safer communication.\noptions: True\n\nFalse\nanswer: True\nexplanation: Evidence can show effort, insight, follow-through and changed behaviour over time.",
