    "practiceActivities": "name: Activity 1: Notice the Pattern\ndurationMinutes: 10\ninstructions: Write one recent or realistic example connected to Formula Feeding Safety. Record the trigger, the child’s likely feeling or need, the adult response, and one safer response to practise next time.\nevidencePrompt: Save the completed pattern note as a reflection or learning record.\n\nname: Activity 2: Practise the Safer Response\ndurationMinutes: 12\ninstructions: Create one sentence, routine, limit, repair statement or practical action that applies Formula Feeding Safety in daily life. Keep it short enough to use when stressed.\nevidencePrompt: Upload the sentence, plan, checklist, script or routine change you created.",
